@@ -8,38 +8,52 @@ A **Progressive Web App (PWA)** that works entirely in your browser — even off
 
 | Feature | What it does |
 |---|---|
-| 💬 **Chat** | Built-in assistant that runs locally (offline). Attach images, ask how to use the app. Optionally connect any OpenAI-compatible API (OpenAI, Groq, OpenRouter, Ollama…) in Settings for real AI replies. |
-| 📁 **Files** | Upload anything via drag & drop or picker. Preview images/video/audio/text, rename, download, delete. Everything stays on your device (IndexedDB). |
-| 🎨 **Editor** | Rotate, flip, crop (drag a box), resize, and apply filters (brightness, contrast, saturation, hue, blur, grayscale, sepia) with one-tap presets. Undo/redo. Export as PNG/JPEG/WebP — save to Files or download. |
-| 🎬 **Image → Video** | Turn one or more images into a real video file with Ken-Burns motion (zoom in/out, pan), fade transitions, custom duration, resolution (720p/1080p/square/vertical Reels), fps and background colour. |
-| 📦 **Export** | Download any single file, or export everything (files + chat history) as a ZIP. Zero-dependency ZIP writer built in. |
-| 📲 **Installable PWA** | Install to your home screen, launches standalone, fully offline via a service worker. |
+| 💬 **Chat** | Built-in offline assistant, 🎙 **voice input** (speech recognition), 🔊 **spoken replies**, **multiple conversation threads**, image attachments with local analysis. Optional: connect any OpenAI-compatible API for **streaming** real AI replies. |
+| 📁 **Files** | Drag & drop upload of anything, **folders**, **tags**, **gallery view** with lightbox, **duplicate finder**, bulk select (delete/move/zip), previews for image/video/audio/text, rename, download. All storage is local (IndexedDB) — nothing leaves your device. |
+| 🎨 **Editor** | ✨ **Auto-enhance**, rotate/flip, crop with **ratio presets** (1:1, 4:5, 16:9, 9:16…), resize, 7 filter sliders + presets, undo/redo. **Draw & annotate**: brush, arrows, rectangles, text, emoji stickers, pixelate (hide sensitive areas). **Watermark** (text, 9 positions, opacity). Export PNG/JPEG/WebP. |
+| 🎬 **Image → Video** | Images → real video file (MP4 where supported, else WebM) with Ken Burns motion, fades, **music track** 🎵 (real WebAudio mixing), **animated text titles**, multiple resolutions (720p/1080p/square/Reels), fps & background colour. |
+| 📦 **Export / Import** | Download any file, export everything as ZIP, and **import ZIP backups back** (also restores chat history). Zero-dependency ZIP reader/writer built in. |
+| 🔐 **Security** | **App lock** (PIN + optional fingerprint/Face ID via WebAuthn) and an **encrypted Vault** — AES-256-GCM with PBKDF2-derived keys; vault files are unreadable without your PIN. |
+| 📲 **PWA** | Installable, offline via service worker, **Share Target** (share images from your phone's share sheet straight into the app), File Handling API support. |
+| ☁️ **Cloud sync** | Optional self-hosted sync server (below): your files & chats on every device. |
 
 ## Tech
 
-- No build step, no frameworks, no external dependencies — plain HTML/CSS/ES modules.
-- **Storage:** IndexedDB (files, chat, settings) — nothing ever leaves the device.
-- **Image → Video:** `<canvas>` animation captured with `MediaRecorder` (records MP4 where supported, otherwise WebM).
-- **PWA:** web app manifest + service worker (pre-cached app shell, stale-while-revalidate).
+- No frontend build step, no frameworks, no dependencies — plain HTML/CSS/ES modules.
+- **Storage:** IndexedDB (files, chat threads, settings) — device-only unless you enable sync.
+- **Video:** `<canvas>` animation + `MediaRecorder`, audio mixed live via `WebAudio`.
+- **Vault:** WebCrypto (PBKDF2 150k + AES-256-GCM).
+- **PWA:** manifest (with share target & file handlers) + service worker (pre-cached shell, stale-while-revalidate).
 
 ## Run locally
 
-Any static server works:
-
 ```bash
+# static only
 python3 -m http.server 8080
-# open http://localhost:8080
+
+# or: site + sync server together (recommended)
+node server/index.js   # → http://localhost:3000
 ```
 
-## Deploy
+## Cloud sync server
+
+`server/index.js` is a **zero-dependency Node server** (auth with scrypt + HMAC tokens, SQLite-free JSON meta + blob files on disk, 500MB/user quota) that also serves the PWA itself — one deployment gives you the app *and* its backend.
+
+**Deploy free (Render):**
+1. Push this repo to GitHub
+2. Open <https://render.com/deploy> and point it at your repo (or use the *New Web Service* flow with `render.yaml` in this repo)
+3. Once live, open the app → Settings → Cloud sync → enter your server URL, create an account, done.
+
+> ⚠️ Render's free plan has an **ephemeral filesystem** (data resets on redeploy) — great for testing.
+> For persistent sync use **Railway** or **Fly.io** with a volume, or a paid Render disk. Env vars: `PORT`, `DATA_DIR`.
+
+**In the app:** Settings → Cloud sync → server URL + email + password → *Create account* → *Sync now*.
+Sync merges files and chat by id (last-write-wins), pushes/pulls automatically after changes, and syncs Vault files while keeping them encrypted.
 
-Live at: **https://ogbas4991.github.io/Ayomide/**
+## Deploy the PWA
 
 GitHub Pages serves this repo's `main` branch — every push to `main` redeploys automatically.
 
-**First-time setup (repo admin, ~30 seconds):**
-1. Open **Settings → Pages** in the repo
-2. Source: **Deploy from a branch**
-3. Branch: **`main`** / `(root)` → **Save**
+**First-time setup (repo admin):** Settings → Pages → Source: *Deploy from a branch* → `main` / `(root)` → Save.
 
-The site also runs anywhere static files run (Netlify, Vercel, Cloudflare, any web server) — no build step required.
+The site also runs anywhere static files run (Netlify, Vercel, Cloudflare…) — no build step required.
